  unitName: Lawful God Aneil
  unitId: 30294
  unitNumber: 648
  description: A good friend of Reed's, the soldier who led many civilians to El
    Gaia during the last stages of the war with the gods. He wished to protect his
    comrades and the people with him, and while traveling to El Gaia, he was advised
    by Heavy God Nevsky to "trust in the eyes of those who relied on his power."
    Heeding this advice, his powers and genius for strategy grew exponentially. It
    is said that he used his magic to protect the people, while he cooperated with
    martial artist Rhein to create military strategies to keep the god army at bay.
  summonDesc: Someone trusts me.<br>It's a lot of pressure on me,<br>but it also
    gives me strength.
  fusionDesc: I'll get stronger<br>to protect everyone.<br>That's the path I chose!
  evoDesc: I've decided<br>to have more confidence in myself.<br>Just like he told
    me to...
  element: 3
  rarity: 4
